	)
	(text "The OpenMV4 needs 3.6-5V power input from the VIN pin, \nsince we are limited to 3V3 input, we connect the power \nplane directly to the 3V3 pins on the MV4 despite them meant \nto be Power Outputs. Because of this, we must be very cognizant \nnever to plus in multiple power sources simultaniously. If \nprogramming with USB, unplug from MTL, if operating on MTL, \nunplug USB first. "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 221.996 71.882 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "749c7cd7-b5b8-4c2c-bb15-eeced3b28f55")
	)
